                </div>

                <div class="bg-blue-900/20 rounded-lg p-6 border border-blue-500/25 mb-6">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-4">Fundamental Trade-Off in 3D Reconstruction</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Current 3D reconstruction approaches face a critical limitation: methods that excel at depth estimation
                        struggle with pose tracking consistency, while methods that provide robust pose tracking produce ambiguous
                        depth information. This project aims to solve this fundamental trade-off through intelligent fusion.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-green-600/25">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-brain mr-2"></i>Feed-Forward Networks (T1)</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-3">
                            <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-white">Strength: Depth Estimation</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Produce clean, metrically-accurate depth maps with absolute scale from single images</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-white">Weakness: Pose Drift</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Small pose errors accumulate over video sequences, causing 3D model drift</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-purple-600/25">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-400 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-chart-line mr-2"></i>Optimization Models (T2)</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-3">
                            <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-white">Strength: Pose Tracking</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Globally-consistent pose estimation that doesn't drift over time</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-white">Weakness: Depth Ambiguity</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Produces pseudo-depth with relative ordering only, lacking absolute scale</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

